{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hexborn is a <strong>blood-fueled roguelite FPS</strong> where 90s-style boomer shooter combat meets <i>Vampire Survivors</i>\u2013style progression and branching <strong>exploration through cursed labyrinths.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast through dungeons with <strong>occult weapons</strong>, carve your path through cultists and abominations, and build <strong>devastating synergies</strong> mid-run. Each chamber brings <strong>escalating horrors</strong> \u2014 <i>survive, adapt, and embrace the curse.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313880/extras/4209f7ded5993ae33eb5bb33d6143a86.poster.avif?t=1773519842\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313880/extras/4209f7ded5993ae33eb5bb33d6143a86.webm?t=1773519842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313880/extras/4209f7ded5993ae33eb5bb33d6143a86.mp4?t=1773519842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\ud83d\udc80 <strong>WISHLIST NOW</strong> to be the first to descend into the Bloodstone Labyrinth \ud83d\udc80</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\ude78 BOOMER SHOOTER CHAOS MEETS RITUAL SURVIVORS COMBAT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight escalating waves in procedurally generated levels inspired by <i>Blood</i>, <i>Doom</i>, and 90s FPS brutality \u2014 every kill fuels the ritual.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313880/extras/e4ca081ee87b52a4ff260bda98b56b13.poster.avif?t=1773519842\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313880/extras/e4ca081ee87b52a4ff260bda98b56b13.webm?t=1773519842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313880/extras/e4ca081ee87b52a4ff260bda98b56b13.mp4?t=1773519842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00<strong> EXPLORE PROCEDURAL DUNGEONS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are the same. Branching paths, cursed shrines, relic rooms, and twisted layouts keep every descent unpredictable and bring back the thrill of uncovering a world, not just surviving it.<br>\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde8<strong>\u00a0OCCULT ARSENAL</strong>   <br>Wield devastating tools like Lucian\u2019s triple-barreled shotgun, the Necronomicon spellbook, and the napalm launcher, all handcrafted to feel brutal, distinct, and satisfying.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313880/extras/b8548fc42b92fc7190ec964b87458b62.poster.avif?t=1773519842\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313880/extras/b8548fc42b92fc7190ec964b87458b62.webm?t=1773519842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313880/extras/b8548fc42b92fc7190ec964b87458b62.mp4?t=1773519842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd2e SURVIVORS-LIKE PROGRESSION WITH RETRO GUNPLAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up mid-run and choose from randomized perks across Blood, Fire, Shadow, and Machine archetypes. Stack synergies and evolve fast.<br>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u267b\ufe0f ENDLESS REPLAYABILITY</strong> <br>Randomized perks, relic trades, enemy waves, and room layouts make every run a fresh, chaotic challenge and every build uniquely broken.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313880/extras/52de5184455d97c24a8ea43fc8f1c366.poster.avif?t=1773519842\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313880/extras/52de5184455d97c24a8ea43fc8f1c366.webm?t=1773519842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313880/extras/52de5184455d97c24a8ea43fc8f1c366.mp4?t=1773519842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>Lucian Cross</strong>, a fallen cultist bound to a demon, trapped in the shifting Bloodstone Labyrinth. Fight to stop the resurrection of a forgotten god or be consumed by the power you wield. Each run is a violent descent into madness, where kills fuel new perks, and every choice reshapes cursed arenas, shrines, and sacrificial chambers. The dungeon is alive, the doors seal behind you\u2026 and the only way out is through.         <br>        <br>Prepare to descend into the darkness, where <strong>every choice could be your last</strong>.  <br>  <br>\ud83d\udc49 <strong>Wishlist Hexborn</strong> and prepare to descend \u2014 the only way out is through.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURED IN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313880/extras/440a3eaed37ea812e0761d1a4872edb1.avif?t=1773519842\" width=600 height=294 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Featured in the <i>Brutal Indies</i> showcase \u2014 curated by leading boomer-shooter creators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><br><br>  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3313880?t=1773519842","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313880/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773519842","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313880/d1ed1348f751e8d3f4f6fda623484c1d17cd657a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773519842","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313880/d1ed1348f751e8d3f4f6fda623484c1d17cd657a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773519842","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hexborn is a <strong>blood-fueled roguelite FPS</strong> where 90s-style boomer shooter combat meets <i>Vampire Survivors</i>\u2013style progression and branching <strong>exploration through cursed labyrinths.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast through dungeons with <strong>occult weapons</strong>, carve your path through cultists and abominations, and build <strong>devastating synergies</strong> mid-run. Each chamber brings <strong>escalating horrors</strong> \u2014 <i>survive, adapt, and embrace the curse.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313880/extras/4209f7ded5993ae33eb5bb33d6143a86.poster.avif?t=1773519842\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313880/extras/4209f7ded5993ae33eb5bb33d6143a86.webm?t=1773519842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.