nt into madness, where kills fuel new perks, and every choice reshapes cursed arenas, shrines, and sacrificial chambers. The dungeon is alive, the doors seal behind you\u2026 and the only way out is through.         <br>        <br>Prepare to descend into the darkness, where <strong>every choice could be your last</strong>.  <br>  <br>\ud83d\udc49 <strong>Wishlist Hexborn</strong> and prepare to descend \u2014 the only way out is through.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURED IN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313880/extras/440a3eaed37ea812e0761d1a4872edb1.avif?t=1773519842\" width=600 height=294 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Featured in the <i>Brutal Indies</i> showcase \u2014 curated by leading boomer-shooter creators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><br><br>  </p>","developers":["Caspian Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313880/50da8a5a9d4efddcff36299aaedab30a0dc4ee99/header.jpg?t=1773519842","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3313880/586772077/be3c8359011e4e93c52d558bebee9860702e5eba/1763590672/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763593285","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3313880/586772077/be3c8359011e4e93c52d558bebee9860702e5eba/1763590672/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763593285","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https: